    {
      "id": "claim_f1b50373f8394ec9aedd2cefe0fe9cd2",
      "statement": "AllocSim provides local simulation of block/inode allocation against copied bitmaps mirroring SimpleBlockAllocator semantics exactly (same hint handling, first-free-bit rule), enabling deterministic post-image construction before WAL commit. AllocSim::new_data_only avoids inode bitmap copy for data-only transactions.",
