      "statement": "DiskManager integration: commit_journal_tx is the central commit point handling Strict overwrite logic; apply_journal_ops is the shared redo path for commit-time apply and mount-time recovery; recover_journal runs during open before publishing the manager; maybe_checkpoint drives deferred checkpointing after each journaled mutation under Strict.",
